<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Dec trade data from Thurs, official says.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Dec trade data from Thurs, official says.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's December trade data will not be released before Thursday, a South African Revenue Services official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The data was originally expected from Monday onwards.</p>
<p>Analysts polled by Reuters forecast a 760 million rand trade surplus in December, up from 378 million in November, with ideas ranging between 400 million rand and 1.3 billion rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
